   "title": "对象prop不合并默认值致treeMethod报错",
   "type": "fact",
   "content": "Vue Object 类型 prop 传入对象整体替换默认值不合并，致 `pubExpenditureContract/detail.vue` 缺失 `treeMethod` 时，`zs-select-dialog-func.vue` 的 `getTree` 调用 `this.$undefined` 报错。组件内提取 `DEFAULT_TREE_CONFIG` 合并配置，或调用处显式声明 `treeMethod` 可消除异常。",
   "evidence": "src=园区公共收益/036.md",
